ober came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years since 1951, tied with February to March for the most. In 2025 the middle ran 167% of normal in April to May but only 72% in August to September. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 39% of normal and May to June at 149%. Grid 22380 had its driest year in 1953 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
